<!--
  HowlBridge Auto-Update Feed
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  This appcast.xml is consumed by Sparkle (macOS) and WinSparkle
  (Windows) running inside the HowlBridge desktop app. Both check
  this URL every 24 hours and prompt users to install new versions.

  DO NOT hand-edit this file in production. The GitHub Actions
  Windows release workflow + scripts/build-mac.sh both update this
  file automatically when a new release is tagged.

  Every <item> must contain TWO <enclosure> tags — one per platform
  (sparkle:os="macos" and sparkle:os="windows") — each with a valid
  Ed25519 signature (sparkle:edSignature) computed against the
  enclosure binary using keys/sparkle_ed_priv.pem.

  Plan: research/2026-05-26-windows-build-signing-gha.md
-->
